/-ai
If the empty string belongs to the master of a datum domain N, then the stream expression on N is rooted.

The expression is a coalesced sum of the constant N with a smash product of the constant N and the variable. Rootedness unpacks as the hypothesis, the hypothesis again, and the trivial rootedness of the variable.
ai-/
